      *=====================================================================*
      *  Tools/400 STRPREPRC instructions:                                  *
      *   >>PRE-COMPILER<<                                                  *
      *     >>CRTCMD<<  RUCRTCBL    TSTPGM(&LI/&OB) +                       *
      *                             SRCFILE(&SL/&SF) SRCMBR(&SM);           *
      *     >>IMPORTANT<<                                                   *
      *       >>PARM<< COPTION(*EVENTF);                                    *
      *       >>PARM<< DBGVIEW(*LIST);                                      *
      *     >>END-IMPORTANT<<                                               *
      *     >>EXECUTE<<                                                     *
      *   >>END-PRE-COMPILER<<                                              *
      *=====================================================================*

      *=====================================================================*
      *  Runtime error: CHKOBJ sends the escape message CPF9801.
      *=====================================================================*
       PROCESS  NOMONOPRC.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEST_ERROR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
         Special-Names.
       Copy CBLLINKAGE Of QINCLUDE.
      * Terminate Special-Names section , because CBLLINKAGE
      * does not do that.
         .
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  cmd     Pic x(41)
               Value "CHKOBJ OBJ(QTEMP/NOTEXIST) OBJTYPE(*FILE)".
       01  cmdLen  Pic S9(10)V9(5) Packed-Decimal Value 41.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       TEST_ERROR.

           Call "QCMDEXC" Using By Content cmd
                                By Content cmdLen.

           GOBACK.

       END PROGRAM TEST_ERROR.

      *=====================================================================*
      *  Failed assertion.
      *=====================================================================*
       PROCESS  NOMONOPRC.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEST_FAILURE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
         Special-Names.
       Copy CBLLINKAGE Of QINCLUDE.
      * Terminate Special-Names section , because CBLLINKAGE
      * does not do that.
         .
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       TEST_FAILURE.

           Call "assert" Using By Content B"0"
                               By Content "Expected failure.".

           GOBACK.

       END PROGRAM TEST_FAILURE.

      *=====================================================================*
      *  Successful assertion.
      *=====================================================================*
       PROCESS  NOMONOPRC.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEST_SUCCESS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
         Special-Names.
       Copy CBLLINKAGE Of QINCLUDE.
      * Terminate Special-Names section , because CBLLINKAGE
      * does not do that.
         .
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       TEST_SUCCESS.

           Call "assert" Using By Content B"1".

           GOBACK.

       END PROGRAM TEST_SUCCESS.
